hanges requested, `◯` review required, blank when\nthere is none), so both survive a narrow column instead of being the\nfirst thing cut off after the title. The trailing `[draft]` / `✓` / `✗`\nbadges are gone. The PR detail header gains a `DRAFT` badge (`isDraft`\nis now part of `gh pr view --json`).\n\nCloses #212\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N7wFSHbpTzvkK6WS1CRS7b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T10:52:48Z","author":{"name":"Kohei Hosokawa","email":"kohei.hosokawa@kiconiaworks.com"},"committer":{"name":"Kohei Hosokawa","email":"kohei.hosokawa@kiconiaworks.com"}},"repository":{"id":1154733606,"node_id":"R_kgDORNPWJg","name":"vig","full_name":"td72/vig","private":false,"owner":{"login":"td72","id":12109493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12109493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72","html_url":"https://github.com/td72","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig","description":"Read-only TUI cockpit for busy repositories: git, GitHub issues/PRs/CI runs/project boards, containers, processes and worktrees at a glance","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos